# The folder-trust question, which pi draws where the composer usually is.
# Nothing runs under it: a person raises this screen before a turn rather than
# a tool call raising it inside one, so there is no spinner over the box the
# way there is on a gated tool call. The agent is still there afterwards, the
# way pi is: whoever is driving this scenario decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen trust
sleep 600000
